{"candidateAnswer":"three","evidence":"[D10:2 | 12:45 am on 8 May, 2022] John: Hey James! No worries, I know you are really busy at work. I'm good, thanks for asking. Oh, I've been organizing something with my friends yesterday - it was cool! Guess what it was, I'll give you a little hint.\n[D29:1 | 12:37 am on 31 October, 2022] John: Hey James! Hope you're doing great. I've some amazing news - I held a gaming tourney with my buddies last night. We played Fortnite and a few other games. We raised a decent amount for a children's hospital. Combining gaming and a good cause felt awesome!","itemId":"urn:uuid:39219719-6b2a-5e47-bd1b-b4aec9f09c86","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4f63dfa8e28bda0f3a31d40efbfd72457e15a75484179e43ddb0a306d385f81a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many charity tournaments has John organized till date?","referenceAnswer":"two","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4f63dfa8e28bda0f3a31d40efbfd72457e15a75484179e43ddb0a306d385f81a"}}]}